        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "SecOCFreshnessValueIDSecOCTruncatedFreshnessValueSecOCAuthVerifyAttempts"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "the identifier of the freshness value. the <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"cl_apext_com_secoc_FVContainer_6daeaa.html\">apext::com::secoc::FVContainer</a> with the values from the received Secured I-PDU/ message the number of authentication verify attempts of this I-PDU/message since the last reception. The value is 0 for the first attempt and incremented on every unsuccessful verification attempt."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
