      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "• If successful: an <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a> containing a ara:: core::Result::value_type containing a apext::com:: secoc::FVContainer that holds the freshness value to be used for the calculation of the authenticator by the SecOC or recoverable error. • If unsuccessful: an <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a> containing an ara:: core::Result::error_type i.e. a corresponding ara:: com::ComErrc"
